  _description: Runs the trading post at Dry Creek. Desert catch sells for twice the Plains price.
  Role: Desert Trader
  Greetings:
  - Dust on your boots already? Welcome to Dry Creek.
  - Water's free. Everything else costs.
  - Snakes, scorpions, long-eared hares. Bring them here.
  Idle: Shake your boots out before you put them on. Trust me.
